      "description": "",
      "raw_text": "No woman should face a crisis alone.\n\nHope Women’s Centerprovides a safe haven for at-risk women and teen girls across Arizona to get back on their feet.\n\nOur mission is to engage, encourage, and equip vulnerable women and teen girls by providing support for their physical, emotional, and spiritual needs.\n\nGet stories of impact straight in your inbox!\n\nTo better serve women in crisis, Hope Women’s Center is expanding its reach across Arizona through ourHope on the Roadmobile program.\n\nBy establishing easily accessible locations across Arizona through partnerships with leading nonprofits, we can reach women wherever they are and provide the support they need.\n\nONE MISSION. ONE STATE. MORE HOPE.",
