      "raw_text": "Our leadership team is dedicated to driving meaningful change by carrying out our mission through the programs and services we provide to the community.\n\nAs the President and CEO, George Dean has impressively guided the League with sound fiscal accountability, responsiveness to issues and community visibility for more than 25 years.\n\nHis leadership focuses on advocacy of issues affecting the underserved communities in the areas of education, training, job placement and economic development.\n\nAs the President and CEO, George Dean has impressively guided the League with sound fiscal accountability, responsiveness to issues and community visibility for more than 25 years.\n\nHis leadership focuses on advocacy of issues affecting the underserved communities in the areas of education, training, job placement and economic development.\n\nAs the President and CEO, George Dean has impressively guided the League with sound fiscal accountability, responsiveness to issues and community visibility for more than 25 years.\n\nHis leadership focuses on advocacy of issues affecting the underserved communities in the areas of education, training, job placement and economic development.",
