  {
    "council_member": "Carla Vargas Jasa",
    "council_position": "President and Chief Executive Officer",
    "organization": "Valley of the Sun United Way",
    "website": "http://vsuw.org",
    "about": {
      "about_url": "https://vsuw.org/about-us/",
      "mission": "",
      "description": "We envision a community where every child, family and individual is healthy, has a safe place to live, and has every opportunity to succeed.",
      "raw_text": "Valley of the Sun United Way is part of a global network for community action. We bring people and resources together to tackle our communities’ toughest challenges.\n\nValley of the Sun United Way envisions a community where every child, family, and individual is healthy, has a safe place to live, and has every opportunity to succeed in school, at work, and in life. As we celebrate 100 years of impact, we continue to unite the Valley around urgent needs and long-term solutions that strengthen Maricopa County. We address community needs through four focus areas: Housing and Homelessness, Health and Hunger, Education, and Workforce Development.\n\nWe support the delivery of programs and provide direct services in Maricopa County to empower local residents.\n\nValley of the Sun United Way sits at the center of our community ecosystem, bringing together organizations and partners to tackle complex challenges that no single organization can solve alone.\n\nWe create impact in five ways:\n\nCollaboration is at the heart of everything we do.\n\nBy convening partners across sectors, aligning resources, and fostering collective action, we help create solutions that are broader, more sustainable, and more impactful than any one organization could achieve independently.\n\nCreating lasting change takes all of us.\n\nWhether you choose to volunteer, donate, participate in workplace giving, join a community coalition, support through gifts-in-kind, or connect through one of our affinity groups, there is a place for you in this work.\n\nYour gift helps strengthen nonprofit partners, expand opportunities, and respond to emerging community needs across the Valley. Every contribution helps create a stronger future for all.\n\nFrom packing school supplies to mentoring students and supporting community events, volunteering is a hands-on way to help individuals and families thrive.\n\nPartner with Valley of the Sun United Way through workplace giving, employee volunteerism, sponsorships, and community initiatives that align purpose with impact.\n\nJoin an affinity group, participate in individual-directed philanthropy, contribute gifts-in-kind, advocate for change, or collaborate through a community coalition. However you choose to engage, your involvement helps strengthen our community.",
      "meta_description": "Valley of the Sun United Way monitors needs, identifies critical social issues and brings the right people together to advance the common good."
    },
