      "about_url": "https://mountainparkhealth.org/about-us/",
      "mission": "",
      "description": "Learn about Mountain Park Health Center—providing affordable, compassionate care to our diverse community through a team-based, patient-centered approach.",
      "raw_text": "Mountain Park Health Center is a nonprofit community health center. For more than 40 years we have been providing whole-patient care for the entire family. Each year we keep nearly 115,000 of our neighbors in Goodyear, Glendale, Tempe, and Phoenix healthy.\n\nMountain Park believes in being proactive about your health. We know that health education, screenings and access to affordable medications help prevent serious health problems. Proactive healthcare can also help manage chronic conditions, like obesity and diabetes, and detect diseases in the most treatable stages. We are here for you anytime you need.\n\nOur caring staff is here to help you navigateAHCCCSor the health insurance marketplace. We can also help you apply forSNAP(formerly called food stamps) andTANF(cash assistance). If you don’t have health insurance, we will work with you to make healthcare affordable through ourSliding Fee Discount Programand other resources.\n\nWe always put our patients first. As a Patient Centered Medical Home, Mountain Park offers all the care you need in one single place. You’ll have access to an entire Care Team of primary care physicians, physician’s assistants, nurse practitioners, clinical pharmacists, behavioral health consultants and registered dietitians all in one exam room.\n\nAll Mountain Park clinics are accredited by The Joint Commission, which accredits healthcare organizations across the nation. This accreditation reflects Mountain Park’s commitment to quality, safety and employee education.To maintain the commission’s Gold Seal of Approval™, Mountain Park demonstrates its commitment to certain performance standards and must undergo an on-site survey by a Joint Commission survey team at least every three years.Learn More\n\nMountain Park Health Center is a deemed facility under the Health Resources and Services Administration’s Federal Tort Claims Act (FTCA).\n\nThis health center is a Health Center Program grantee under 42 U.S.C. 254b, and a deemed Public Health Service employee under 42 U.S.C. 233(g)-(n).",
      "meta_description": "Mountain Park Center offers comprehensive, community-based affordable healthcare services for everyone in your family in the greater Phoenix area."
